### Common Patterns

#### Pattern 1: Extract Default from Array
```javascript
const defaultItem = useMemo(() => {
  if (!record?.items?.length) return null;
  return record.items.find(item => item.is_default) || record.items[0];
}, [record?.items]);
```

#### Pattern 2: Sort Array by Priority
```javascript
const sortedItems = useMemo(() => {
  if (!record?.items) return [];
  const order = { high: 1, medium: 2, low: 3 };
  return [...record.items].sort((a, b) => 
    (order[a.priority] || 99) - (order[b.priority] || 99)
  );
}, [record?.items]);
```

#### Pattern 3: Limit Array Results
```javascript
const recentItems = useMemo(() => {
  return record?.items?.slice(0, 5) || [];
}, [record?.items]);
```

#### Pattern 4: Filter Array
```javascript
const activeItems = useMemo(() => {
  return record?.items?.filter(item => item.status === 'ACTIVE') || [];
}, [record?.items]);
```

