**Metrics from CustomerView and OrderView refactors:**

| Metric | Before (Supabase) | After (useModuleRetrieve) | Improvement |
|--------|-------------------|---------------------------|-------------|
| Lines of Code | 150-200 lines | 60-100 lines | **60-75% reduction** |
| API Calls | 4-6+ queries | 1 API call | **4-6x fewer** |
| State Variables | 8-12 useState | 1 (from hook) | **8-12x simpler** |
| useEffect Hooks | 2-3 complex | 0 | **Eliminated** |
| Loading States | 3-4 separate | 1 unified | **3-4x simpler** |

